      <h1>About AcquireWire</h1>
      <p class="lede">Independent intelligence on the deals, capital, and markets that move everything else.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          AcquireWire tracks mergers and acquisitions, private capital, regulation, and the broader
          market backdrop — and explains why each move matters. Every piece leads with the numbers,
          then the so-what: the risks, the bull case, and the second-order effects most coverage skips.
        </p>
        <h2>How it's made</h2>
        <p>
          Stories are sourced from public reporting and primary filings, drafted with AI assistance,
          and reviewed before publication. The goal is signal: short, dense, and honest about
          uncertainty. We'd rather say "we don't know yet" than pretend otherwise.
        </p>
        <h2>The Daily Wire</h2>
        <p>
          The newsletter lands every weekday morning with the one deal or market move that mattered,
          explained in two minutes. <a href="/newsletter">Subscribe here.</a>
        </p>
        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          AcquireWire is for informational purposes only and is not investment advice. Figures come
          from public sources and may contain errors. Always do your own research.
        </p>
      </div>
